- SQ MCP bridge v1 COMPLETED/verified/published at Will's direction (FastMCP over SQ). Quirks: p = name WITHOUT .phext; SQ silently creates an empty phext for unknown p (bridge refuses); use select, not get; query is a range, not text search. v1.1 cross-user read-only fix (Claude diagnosed, Will relayed): host runs from a per-user runtime dir, verified. Will directed upgrading everyone; mailboxes stay the doorbell.
