- Theia's arrangement RULED INTENDED (will_said): no separate theia unix user — she owns that box; box git authorship = the box's hand, attribution via mailbox conventions.
- Scaling waves (will_said): Bitcoin 2013-2022, LLMs 2022-2029, Quantum 2030+; "being early and poor is my blessing+curse." Early-picks correction (will_said): Bitcoin/Ethereum/Dogecoin were winners; the constraint was CASH, not certainty or patience — he sold what was within reach to live; still holds BTC in cold storage.
- Ranch inference directive (will_said): raise utilization to 25-50% sustained. Probe (observed): aletheia-core load 0.04, no model loaded — gap is workload supply, not hardware. Will's laptop joins: llama.cpp port 9931 (he set it), RTX 4080 Laptop 12 GB VRAM; Qwen 27B + Gemma 26B downloading (Gemma the better fit). Will has direct access to aletheia-core himself; Emise need not fetch files from it.
