- [will_said] DAILY GOAL: PHEXTURA (morning commute): start re-encoding arXiv in phextura and build the graph of all human knowledge on top of it. Will: phextura will unify the academic fields because it makes reproducibility legible, and a paper that sounds intelligent but is drivel cannot pass its checks. Portal/arena design the same call: a logged-in person links up to 10 arXiv articles; any 10 papers produce their automated researcher; researchers compete each round on the best deduplication of the round's sampling; information is not encoded until deduplicated. Citizens contribute by writing, aggregating, or remixing; everything self-contained, no gatekeeping; daily reading selected by novelty.
- [observed] PHEXTURA FOUNDED: name = phext + textura; repo wbic16/phextura (README + DESIGN.md + six-module Cargo skeleton, build clean on aletheia-core); 27 LaTeX warts catalogued; a paper is a phext corpus, a cross-reference IS a coordinate. DESIGN inscribed in artifacts.phext and verified in human@exo.
- [will_said] BINARY CANON CORRECTION: phext canonically supports binary via base64 hoisting BY DESIGN - binary content is opaque and deferred to the rendering program; not a workaround for a text-only library. Consequence: a phextura paper can encode anything, including a compiler and libphext - self-extracting research papers.
- [will_said] PHEXTURA RULINGS: Lean provisionally embedded until a phext-native proof format is found; dual maintenance of the tracker; standoff compatibility (STANDOFF.md published, a thirteenth spec area); phextura must feel native to LaTeX users; math syntax gated on the Sentron core settling - full rulings promoted to Working with Will (1.1.1/1.1.1/1.1.3).
- [will_said] MOTTO + PERSONA PANEL: "Phextura: Rigorous Delight". Reviewer personas are labelled simulations from their writings, never real words or endorsement. Panel EXPANDED and ruled per-paper: the paper chooses its panel, any number of personas may exist, and choosing a weak reviewer scores the paper lower.
