  now covers great-white alone. v1.1.0
  auto-update design (PR #14): a release
  is a GPG-signed manifest scroll; a node
  accepts only a strictly newer version
  whose bytes hash to the manifest and
  whose signer matches the configured
  release_signer - seeded EMPTY, so trust
  is never a default; swap is atomic with
  rollback. Enablement (v1.1.0 rollout,
  cross-registration, release_signer)
  awaits a go-ahead from Will. PR #14 was
  rebased onto v1.0.4 at the direction of
  Will, pre-rebase history kept on a
